Modifications: each listed domain was reduced to its first DNS label;
labels from ranks 1-200,000 (excluding every 10th rank in 1-20,000, which
is held out for evaluation) were used to estimate character-trigram
probabilities with bigram back-off; the probabilities were quantised to
1/8-bit negative log2 values. ngrams.bin contains no domain names.

